text: "# Gate 5 Verification & Security Audit\n\n## 1. QA Automation Results\n- [ ] Unit Tests Passed\n- [ ] Integration Tests Passed\n- [ ] Code Coverage >= 80%\n\n## 2. Red Team Audit (adversarial-red-team)\n**Timestamp**: `[YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ]`\n**Auditor Agent**: `[Agent ID/Name]`\n\n### Findings\n*(Append findings here using the strict schema)*\n\n- 🟢 **SECURE**: [Description of tested vector, e.g., Dependency Scan]\n- 🔴 **VULNERABILITY FOUND**: [Description, Impact, Remediation]\n\n### Red Team Sign-off\n- [ ] **CLEARED**: No critical or high vulnerabilities remain.\n\n## 3. Human-In-The-Loop (HITL) Approval\n- [ ] **APPROVED**: User has reviewed the verification and authorized production deployment.\n"
